School district vehicles-flashing lights
SF0005
authorized.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Cooper, French, Landen, Laursen, D and
Schuler and Representative(s) Lawley and Winter
AN ACT relating to motor vehicles; specifying that school district vehicles
that are not school buses and are used for transporting students may display
flashing lights as specified; and providing for an effective date.
